{
  "name": "ReviewPilot - Analyze Pull Request",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ReviewPilot - Analyze Pull Request (Fase 5 — Gemini Chat Model)\n- **Webhook Trigger (`Receive Review Dispatch`):** autenticado via credencial Header Auth (`ReviewPilot Internal Service Auth`).\n- **Validação Determinística (`Validate Dispatch Payload`):** valida campos obrigatórios de `contracts/review-request.schema.json`.\n- **Modelo LLM (`Google Gemini Chat Model`):** configurado com `models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite` (`temperature: 0.1`, `maxOutputTokens: 4096`) e credencial criptografada `ReviewPilot Google Gemini API` (`googlePalmApi`).\n- **AI Agent Slot (`Stage Placeholder - Review Agent (Phase 7)`):** na Fase 7 será substituído pelo nó `AI Agent (Tools Agent)` conectado à saída `ai_languageModel` do `Google Gemini Chat Model` e às ferramentas MCP somente leitura.\n- **Retorno ao Backend (`Submit Review Result` / `Report Execution Failure`):** envia resultado ou falha controlada aos endpoints `/api/internal/v1/reviews/{id}/results` e `/failure`.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 680
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000001",
      "name": "Architecture Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "reviewpilot-dispatch",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000002",
      "name": "Receive Review Dispatch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        200,
        360
      ],
      "webhookId": "reviewpilot-dispatch",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "CREDENTIAL_ID_INTERNAL_SERVICE_AUTH",
          "name": "ReviewPilot Internal Service Auth"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Receives internal dispatch from Spring Boot backend authenticated with X-Internal-Service-Token."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-review-execution-id",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.reviewExecutionId }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-repo-full-name",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.repositoryFullName }}",
              "rightValue": "^[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+/[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+$",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-pr-number",
              "leftValue": "={{ Number($json.body.pullRequestNumber) }}",
              "rightValue": 1,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-head-sha",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.expectedHeadSha }}",
              "rightValue": "^[0-9a-fA-F]{40}$",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-base-branch",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.baseBranch }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000003",
      "name": "Validate Dispatch Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        360
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Validates required fields from contracts/review-request.schema.json."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={\n  \"status\": \"ACCEPTED\",\n  \"reviewExecutionId\": \"{{ $json.body.reviewExecutionId }}\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 202
        }
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000004",
      "name": "Acknowledge Dispatch Accepted",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        700,
        260
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Returns 202 Accepted to backend immediately after payload validation."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "field-event-id",
              "name": "eventId",
              "value": "={{ $('Receive Review Dispatch').item.json.body.eventId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "field-execution-id",
              "name": "reviewExecutionId",
              "value": "={{ $('Receive Review Dispatch').item.json.body.reviewExecutionId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "field-repo-name",
              "name": "repositoryFullName",
              "value": "={{ $('Receive Review Dispatch').item.json.body.repositoryFullName }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "field-pr-number",
              "name": "pullRequestNumber",
              "value": "={{ Number($('Receive Review Dispatch').item.json.body.pullRequestNumber) }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "field-expected-sha",
              "name": "expectedHeadSha",
              "value": "={{ $('Receive Review Dispatch').item.json.body.expectedHeadSha }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "field-base-branch",
              "name": "baseBranch",
              "value": "={{ $('Receive Review Dispatch').item.json.body.baseBranch }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "field-sonar-key",
              "name": "sonarProjectKey",
              "value": "={{ $('Receive Review Dispatch').item.json.body.sonarProjectKey ?? null }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "field-schema-version",
              "name": "schemaVersion",
              "value": "1.0",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "field-prompt-version",
              "name": "promptVersion",
              "value": "1.0.0",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000005",
      "name": "Prepare Agent Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        960,
        260
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Normalizes traceability fields before invoking the Review Agent."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "agent-analyzed-sha",
              "name": "analyzedHeadSha",
              "value": "={{ $json.expectedHeadSha }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "agent-model",
              "name": "model",
              "value": "models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "agent-summary",
              "name": "summary",
              "value": "Esqueleto do workflow n8n com Google Gemini Chat Model pré-configurado (Fase 5). O nó AI Agent (Tools Agent) e as ferramentas MCP somente leitura serão conectados nas Fases 6 e 7.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "agent-findings",
              "name": "findings",
              "value": "=[]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "agent-limitations",
              "name": "limitations",
              "value": "=[\"Fase 5: no Google Gemini Chat Model pre-configurado; conexao completa com AI Agent (Tools Agent) e servidores MCP sera habilitada nas Fases 6 e 7.\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "agent-usage",
              "name": "usage",
              "value": "={\"inputTokens\": null, \"outputTokens\": null}",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000006",
      "name": "Stage Placeholder - Review Agent (Phase 7)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1220,
        260
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Replaced by @n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent (Tools Agent) in Phase 7."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "options": {
          "maxOutputTokens": 4096,
          "temperature": 0.1
        }
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000012",
      "name": "Google Gemini Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1220,
        480
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "CREDENTIAL_ID_GOOGLE_GEMINI",
          "name": "ReviewPilot Google Gemini API"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Configured in Phase 5 (models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite, temperature=0.1, maxOutputTokens=4096). Connects to AI Agent Chat Model input in Phase 7."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "norm-schema-version",
              "name": "schemaVersion",
              "value": "={{ $('Prepare Agent Context').item.json.schemaVersion }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "norm-exec-id",
              "name": "reviewExecutionId",
              "value": "={{ $('Prepare Agent Context').item.json.reviewExecutionId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "norm-repo",
              "name": "repositoryFullName",
              "value": "={{ $('Prepare Agent Context').item.json.repositoryFullName }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "norm-pr",
              "name": "pullRequestNumber",
              "value": "={{ $('Prepare Agent Context').item.json.pullRequestNumber }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "norm-sha",
              "name": "analyzedHeadSha",
              "value": "={{ $json.analyzedHeadSha }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "norm-model",
              "name": "model",
              "value": "={{ $json.model }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "norm-prompt-version",
              "name": "promptVersion",
              "value": "={{ $('Prepare Agent Context').item.json.promptVersion }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "norm-summary",
              "name": "summary",
              "value": "={{ $json.summary }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "norm-findings",
              "name": "findings",
              "value": "={{ $json.findings }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "norm-limitations",
              "name": "limitations",
              "value": "={{ $json.limitations }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "norm-usage",
              "name": "usage",
              "value": "={{ $json.usage }}",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000007",
      "name": "Validate and Normalize Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1480,
        240
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Ensures payload matches contracts/review-result.schema.json."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=http://host.docker.internal:8080/api/internal/v1/reviews/{{ $json.reviewExecutionId }}/results",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000008",
      "name": "Submit Review Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1740,
        240
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "CREDENTIAL_ID_INTERNAL_SERVICE_AUTH",
          "name": "ReviewPilot Internal Service Auth"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Submits structured result to Backend internal callback endpoint."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "fail-stage",
              "name": "stage",
              "value": "AI_AGENT_EXECUTION",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fail-code",
              "name": "errorCode",
              "value": "MODEL_OR_WORKFLOW_FAILURE",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fail-message",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "Falha controlada durante a execucao do workflow de analise no n8n.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fail-retryable",
              "name": "retryable",
              "value": false,
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000009",
      "name": "Build Failure Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1480,
        440
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Builds sanitized failure payload without secrets or raw stack traces."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=http://host.docker.internal:8080/api/internal/v1/reviews/{{ $('Prepare Agent Context').item.json.reviewExecutionId }}/failure",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000010",
      "name": "Report Execution Failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1740,
        440
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "CREDENTIAL_ID_INTERNAL_SERVICE_AUTH",
          "name": "ReviewPilot Internal Service Auth"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Notifies Backend when workflow or AI Agent execution fails."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "{\n  \"status\": \"INVALID_PAYLOAD\",\n  \"message\": \"Missing or invalid required fields in review dispatch payload.\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 422
        }
      },
      "id": "b71d9d31-6e28-4f6a-9831-000000000011",
      "name": "Reject Invalid Dispatch Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        700,
        500
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Returns HTTP 422 when dispatch payload violates contracts/review-request.schema.json."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Receive Review Dispatch": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Validate Dispatch Payload",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Validate Dispatch Payload": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Acknowledge Dispatch Accepted",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Reject Invalid Dispatch Payload",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Acknowledge Dispatch Accepted": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Prepare Agent Context",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Prepare Agent Context": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Stage Placeholder - Review Agent (Phase 7)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Stage Placeholder - Review Agent (Phase 7)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Validate and Normalize Result",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Build Failure Payload",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Validate and Normalize Result": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Submit Review Result",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Submit Review Result": {
      "main": [
        [],
        [
          {
            "node": "Build Failure Payload",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Build Failure Payload": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Report Execution Failure",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "timezone": "UTC",
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "all",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "all",
    "saveManualExecutions": true,
    "executionTimeout": 180
  },
  "versionId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "tags": []
}
